<div style="font-size: 13px; color: #d63384; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1;"><span style="color: #d63384; border-bottom: 2px solid #d633847d; padding-bottom: 2px;">編輯推薦</span></div>
<h5 style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; color: #5a5a5a; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; max-height: 4.2em; word-break: break-word;">錯看趙建銘！阿扁自責向女兒致歉　陳幸妤反應曝光</h5>
</div>
</a></div>
