<div style="display: table-cell; width: 120px; height: 90px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: #f0f0f0;"><img style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; max-height: 90px; object-fit: cover;" src="https://static.kmedia.com.tw/prd/2026/0911/CD761E2AEC2DCF71B1E5388C66077299/649a20cd3ce738788b43ce8acdd024c2.webp" alt="泰山經營權之戰被罰300萬！前董座詹景超挨告求償　結果出爐"></div>
